                              "panelSpec": {
                                "title": "Which Way Does It Turn?",
                                "lines": [
                                  "Two gears MESH when their teeth interlock and drive each other.",
                                  "Driver = the gear you turn (input). Driven = the gear it drives (output).",
                                  "1. Click the gear train to spin driver A.",
                                  "2. Watch the white arrow on each gear.",
                                  "3. Meshed gears always turn OPPOSITE ways.",
                                  "4. Count meshes: each mesh flips direction again.",
                                  "Then use the blue button to PREDICT gear D."
                                ],
                                "accent": "#e0b24a",
                                "width": 7.5,
                                "live": false
                              },
