      "anchorExample": "A hand-built gear train on a drilled craft stick that must make the final gear spin 8 times faster than the first, using a compound gear.",
      "courseTitle": "Gears and More Gears: Building Drive Trains",
      "courseGoal": "Learners assemble gear sets, predict rotation direction, and calculate simple and compound gear ratios to design drive trains that meet speed and direction targets.",
